{#
  Item create / edit page (REQ-UI-003): UiKit form scaffold. Variables: page (View\FormPage from
  DashboardPages::itemForm(); edit pages carry the danger zone), collection (BreadcrumbCollection), item
  (BreadcrumbItem or null). The items list opens the same form in a dialog (_item_form_partial.html.twig); this page is
  its full-page / no-JS fallback.
  Data block filled: nowo_ui_form_body (form-level errors, then the default child loop).
#}
{% extends '@NowoUiKit/page/form.html.twig' %}
{% trans_default_domain 'NowoBreadcrumbKitBundle' %}

{% block nowo_ui_form_body %}
    {{ form_errors(form) }}
    {{ parent() }}
{% endblock %}
